" end="02:11.520">And </span><span begin="02:11.520" end="02:11.760">I </span><span begin="02:11.760" end="02:14.100">taste </span><span begin="02:14.100" end="02:15.090">what </span><span begin="02:15.090" end="02:15.780">I </span><span begin="02:15.780" end="02:16.530">could </span><span begin="02:16.530" end="02:18.240">never </span><span begin="02:18.240" end="02:19.560">have</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.550" end="02:23.220"><span begin="02:20.550" end="02:20.730">It </span><span begin="02:20.730" end="02:21.120">was </span><span begin="02:21.120" end="02:21.510">from </span><span begin="02:21.510" end="02:23.220">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.790" end="02:35.970"><span begin="02:23.790" end="02:24.360">All </span><span begin="02:24.360" end="02:24.720">those </span><span begin="02:24.720" end="02:27.240">times </span><span begin="02:27.240" end="02:27.690">that </span><span begin="02:27.690" end="02:27.960">I </span><span begin="02:27.960" end="02:30.420">tried</span><span begin="02:30.420" end="02:30.420">, </span><span begin="02:30.420" end="02:30.960">my </span><span begin="02:30.960" end="02:33.210">intention</span><span begin="02:33.210" end="02:33.660">, </span><span begin="02:33.660" end="02:34.230">full </span><span begin="02:34.230" end="02:34.530">of </span><span begin="02:34.530" end="02:35.970">pride</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.350" end="02:45.390"><span begin="02:37.350" end="02:37.500">And </span><span begin="02:37.500" end="02:37.740">I </span><span begin="02:37.740" end="02:40.560">waste </span><span begin="02:40.560" end="02:40.980">more </span><span begin="02:40.980" end="02:41.910">time </span><span begin="02:41.910" end="02:42.780">than </span><span begin="02:42.780" end="02:45.390">anyone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.380" end="02:52.830"><span begin="02:49.380" end="02:49.710">But </span><span begin="02:49.710" end="02:50.190">I'm </span><span begin="02:50.190" end="02:50.550">on </span><s